== Walkthrough ==

''[[Lyris Moonbane]] is located at 301, -445 in the Shrine of Bertoxxulous Guild Hall.''

You say, 'Hail, Lyris Moonbane'

: She doesn't respond.

'''Hand [[Lyris Moonbane]] your [[Blood Stained Note (Guild Summons)|Blood Stained Note]].'''

:: ''a tattered note reads:''

:: <code>In death, there is life. Shunned from the light and society of the above world, make your way through the filthy sewers, to a place where your dark skills can be honed. Take this note to Lyris Moonbane, she has a small task for you if you feel you are worthy.</code>

: Lyris Moonbane says, 'A new initiate always pleases me, here is your tunic.'

